WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,660
My concubine is ridiculously strong

2
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:08,660
It seems like another person who relies on his concubines to bully the poor.

3
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,260
What bullshit? Ten honors and five wins?

4
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,340
What kind of bullshit does a seventeen-year-old bully five corpses?

5
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:14,460
It's all rubbish piled up based on other people's inheritance.

6
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:26,620
Sooner or later, I will kill all of you solitary creatures.

7
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:32,230
You actually killed my uncle

8
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:33,520
why

9
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:39,360
only you here

10
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:41,530
Who else could it be if it wasn't you?

11
00:00:41,530 --> 00:00:48,170
Kill him to avenge uncle

12
00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:49,370
if not you

13
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:51,420
Do you know who that young master is?

14
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:52,820
Meng Feifan

15
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,920
Excalibur Meng Feifan

16
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,920
He has no contact with me, Liu Jiasu

17
00:00:56,920 --> 00:01:03,780
And why do you want to kill my uncle and say get out of the way?
